20) COMMON INTERVIEW MISTAKES
===============================================================================

1) saying concurrent means same timestamp
2) using wall clock as truth
3) overwriting one write
4) using counters with LWW
5) ignoring partition tolerance
6) not discussing merge semantics
7) forgetting vector metadata cost
8) no strategy for sibling compaction

