21) ONE-LINE MEMORY HOOKS
===============================================================================

- Simple writes → lost updates
- Concurrent = no causal order
- Vector clock = causality detector
- No dominance = concurrent
- Siblings = preserve all truths
- Merge = domain specific
- Counters merge by SUM
- Carts merge by UNION

